### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login as normal user
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "user123"
}

### After copying the token from login, use Postman Bearer Token auth:
### GET http://localhost:8080/employees?page=1&limit=5&sort=name&order=asc
### GET http://localhost:8080/employees?department=IT
### POST http://localhost:8080/employees
### {
###   "name": "Rahul Sharma",
###   "email": "rahul@example.com",
###   "department": "IT",
###   "salary": 45000
### }
